ent-citations></citations></technical-data><parties><applicants><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA AKIRA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>IBIDEN CO LTD</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAKUTA NORIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOMORI TERUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHNO KAZUSHIGE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, AKIRA</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>IBIDEN CO., LTD.</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKUTA, NORIYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMORI, TERUO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHNO, KAZUSHIGE</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA AKIRA</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KAKUTA NORIYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KOMORI TERUO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>OHNO KAZUSHIGE</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>HASEGAWA, AKIRA</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KAKUTA, NORIYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KOMORI, TERUO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>OHNO, KAZUSHIGE</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A silicon-containing ceramic carrier for a catalyst, characterized in that the surface of each particle thereof is coated with an alumina thin film. The carrier is prepared by a method comprising providing a carrier having an oxide film of a silicide, immersing the carrier into a solution of an aluminum-containing metal compound, heating the resulting mixture followed by drying, burning preliminarily the dried product, then subjecting the burned product to a treatment of immersing into a hot water, and burning the treated product. The carrier for a catalyst has an alumina thin film formed thereon, and also has a large pore diameter, a great porosity and a decreased pressure loss.</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un support en céramique contenant du silicium pour un catalyseur, caractérisé en ce que la surface de chacune de ses particules est revêtue d'une couche mince d'oxyde d'aluminium. Le support est préparé selon un procédé consistant à produire un support doté d'une couche mince d'oxyde d'un siliciure, à immerger le support dans une solution d'un composé métallique contenant de l'aluminium, à chauffer le mélange obtenu puis à sécher, à cuire préalablement le produit séché, ensuite à soumettre le produit cuit à un traitement d'immersion dans de l'eau chaude et à cuire le produit traité. Le support de catalyseur est recouvert d'une couche mince d'oxyde d'aluminium, il présente également un grand diamètre de pore, une grande porosité et une perte de pression réduite.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>